    "Name": "Shieldmaiden SHM-OC",
    "Details": "One of three Command versions of the Shieldmaiden, the OC has an heavily armored Command Console, C3 Master computer and Angel ECM to aid the battlefield commander. A combination of five different Anti-Missile Systems ensures the 'Mech can still fulfill its defensive duties, while two Light AC/5 and four ER Large Laser provide some self-defense capabilities. Fur further protection a 13 ton Shield is carried in the left arm.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Defensive Duties</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
